    "detailed_description": "Legends from Lacoytas: The First Seeker is a challenging top down shooter where you are given a crossbow and sword to shoot and slash your way through unique enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Challenging combat that requires players to constantly adapt based on their available weapons and the current enemies.<br></li><li> At least 4 normal enemies.<br></li><li> At least 4 bosses.<br></li><li> A short story focused mode in which you will save a village from local bandits and can learn more about the protagonist.<br></li><li> An endless mode where you will fight infinite waves of randomly selected enemies. What's the highest score you can achieve?<br></li><li> An overpowered floor.</li></ul>",
